                </command><command>
                        <name>Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.OperationalData.PIEquipment_OP.OPModel.Commands.SynchronizeProcessAdditionalProperties</name>
                        <shortname>SynchronizeProcessAdditionalProperties</shortname>
                        <description>Synchronizes process properties with the process properties of the given Equipment Configuration. The command returns the following checks the given Equipment Configuration:  1. if the given Id exists, if not error 10300 is returned;  2. if the ProcessAdditionalPropertiesConfiguration (related to it) exists, if not error 10996 is returned;  3. if the respective Equipment entity exists, if not the error 10996 is returned;  4. if the ProcessAdditionalProperties (related to the Equipment entity) exists, if not error 10996 is returned;  5. if the respective Equipment entity is not Frozen, if so error 10992 is returned; The command updates the following attributes:  - AllowedMaterialGroupNId,  - AllowedMaterialNId,  - IsSingleLot,  - IsSingleMaterial,  - MaxLevel,  - MinLevel,  - MaxQuantity,  - MinQuantity,  - Quantity.UoMNId, - MainStateMachineNId.</description>
                        <assembly>Siemens.SimaticIT.UAPI.OperationalData.PIEquipment_OP.OPModel.Commands, Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null</assembly>
                        <dotnetcommandtype></dotnetcommandtype>
